<script setup lang="ts">
type Cohort={people:number;converted:number;rate:number|null;total_rate:number|null};
export type ConversionData={coverage:{comparison:{clicked:Cohort;not_clicked:Cohort};p_value:number|null;currency:string;covered:number;paid_orders:number;paid_amount:number;pending_orders:number;outstanding:number|null}[];cohort:{received:Cohort;not_received:Cohort};difference_pp:number|null;p_value:number|null;cohort_start:string;cohort_end:string};
defineProps<{report:ConversionData}>();
</script>
<template><section class="conversion"><h3>催付覆盖单现状（近 30 天）</h3><p>催付覆盖统计与点击后的新订单归因分开计算。</p><p v-for="r in report.coverage" :key="r.currency">{{r.currency}} · 覆盖 {{r.covered}} 单 · 已付 {{r.paid_amount.toFixed(2)}}（{{r.paid_orders}} 单） · 仍欠 {{r.outstanding===null?'余额待同步':r.outstanding.toFixed(2)}}（{{r.pending_orders}} 单）<br>付款率：点过 {{r.comparison.clicked.rate??'—'}}%（{{r.comparison.clicked.converted}}/{{r.comparison.clicked.people}} 单） / 没点 {{r.comparison.not_clicked.rate??'—'}}%（{{r.comparison.not_clicked.converted}}/{{r.comparison.not_clicked.people}} 单） · p={{r.p_value??'样本不足'}}</p><p v-if="!report.coverage.length">暂无已发送催付并同步订单状态的记录</p><h3>订阅者下单转化（固定 14 天 · D1+）</h3><p>已满 14 天观察窗口的订阅批次：{{report.cohort_start}} 至 {{report.cohort_end}}</p><div class="groups"><p>收到欢迎信 <b>{{report.cohort.received.rate??'—'}}%</b>（{{report.cohort.received.converted}}/{{report.cohort.received.people}} 人；总转化 {{report.cohort.received.total_rate??'—'}}%）</p><p>没收到 <b>{{report.cohort.not_received.rate??'—'}}%</b>（{{report.cohort.not_received.converted}}/{{report.cohort.not_received.people}} 人）</p><p>差值 {{report.difference_pp??'—'}} pp · p={{report.p_value??'样本不足'}}</p></div><p>统计订阅后第 2—14 天的首个已付款订单；首次订阅时间不随退订改变。两组不是随机分配，差值与 p 值不能证明邮件带来增量。p 值采用双侧两比例正态近似，样本不足时不计算。</p></section></template>
